<!--
  State-specific constants for New Jersey (NJ)

  New Jersey has a progressive income tax with 7 tax brackets.
  Tax rates: 1.4%, 1.75%, 3.5%, 5.525%, 6.37%, 8.97%, and 10.75%

  Single filer brackets (2025):
  - $0 - $20,000: 1.4%
  - $20,001 - $35,000: 1.75%
  - $35,001 - $40,000: 3.5%
  - $40,001 - $75,000: 5.525%
  - $75,001 - $500,000: 6.37%
  - $500,001 - $1,000,000: 8.97%
  - Over $1,000,000: 10.75%

  Married filing jointly brackets (2025):
  - $0 - $20,000: 1.4%
  - $20,001 - $50,000: 1.75%
  - $50,001 - $70,000: 2.45%
  - $70,001 - $80,000: 3.5%
  - $80,001 - $150,000: 5.525%
  - $150,001 - $500,000: 6.37%
  - $500,001 - $1,000,000: 8.97%
  - Over $1,000,000: 10.75%

  Personal exemptions:
  - Personal exemption: $1,000
  - Dependent exemption: $1,500 per dependent

  This file will be merged into TaxReturn_edd.xml by scripts/merge-states.sh
-->
